d":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-04-29T15:35:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T14:12:57Z","closed_at":"2025-04-30T14:23:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105910","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105910.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105910.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-30T14:23:36Z"},"body":"GLOBAL_GET is an expensive operation which should not be used each frame / tick. This PR adds macros which do a cheaper revision check, and only call the expensive GLOBAL_GET when project settings have changed.\r\n\r\nForward port of #103763\r\n\r\nBriefly speaking, there are a number of efficient ways of accessing `ProjectSettings` on change rather than querying them each time, but contributors often take the easy approach of calling `GLOBAL_GET`. This is potentially very expensive call, and so we introduced a macro `GLOBAL_GET_CACHED` which caches the result and only retrieves on changes to project settings.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* See #103763 for rational and discussion.\r\n* We can't use this approach with `String` unfortunately as that doesn't play nicely with static lifetime, so this PR is concerned mostly with basic types.\r\n* Cases where `SNAME` was used, the `SNAME` was removed. It is no longer necessary as the cached version should be far more efficient (and `SNAME` version doesn't compile either).\r\n* There seem to be a few cases where the same variable is `GLOBAL_GOT` in multiple places in the same switch statement. These are converted naively for now but could probably be consolidated into a single local variable.\r\n* We may be able to do the same for editor settings.\r\n* It is possible there is some way of getting rid of the type parameter, through the use of e.g. auto and / or template, but it also needs to be able to store the statics locally.\r\n\r\nI did as many cases as I could find before losing the will to live, there are probably more. I have probably converted one or two which don't really need it (not being familiar with all areas of the engine), but there is hardly any penalty for this in terms of binary size. There are probably also a few cases I've missed.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105910/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105910/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}